    </node><node id="re29"><data key="dcells">the cells of the step before: platelets, lung mast cells, endothelium, monocytes, synovial fibroblasts (human)</data><data key="dsite">luminal face of the endoplasmic reticulum and the nuclear envelope, the peroxidase of the same enzyme</data><data key="dref">pubmed:1905721 pubmed:1380156 pubmed:7738031 pubmed:10381787 pubmed:12233875</data><data key="ng">
