    </node><node id="re10"><data key="dcells">no human cell measured. Mice without cPGES make normal amounts of PGE2, so it is drawn with that caveat</data><data key="dsite">cytosol (cPGES) and, for mPGES-2, made on the Golgi and then cut to a form around the nucleus</data><data key="dref">pubmed:10377395 pubmed:10922363 pubmed:11866447 pubmed:19010439 pubmed:12835322 pubmed:17438133 pubmed:15225371</data><data key="ng">
