    </node><node id="re48"><data key="dcells">kidney, liver and intestine (PTGR1, expression). Inflammatory macrophages (PTGR2, human). The same enzyme also inactivates lipoxin A4</data><data key="dsite">cytosol, the same compartment as the oxidation before it</data><data key="dref">pubmed:25619643 pubmed:19000823 pubmed:40388646 pubmed:17449869 pubmed:12432949 pubmed:8576264 pubmed:10837478</data><data key="ng">
